  "Sign in to VRChat": "登入 VRChat",
  "The password is used for this one request and is never stored.": "密碼僅用於這一次請求，絕不會被儲存。",
  "Username or email": "使用者名稱或電子郵件",
  "Password": "密碼",
  "Signing in…": "登入中…",
  "Use a device code": "使用裝置代碼",
  "Signing in is optional. Without it AntiBot only reads VRChat's local log, so the instance list can be inaccurate and player details are unavailable. The password is used for this one request and is never stored; the session is kept out of the settings folder.": "登入是選用的。不登入時 AntiBot 只讀取 VRChat 本機日誌，實例列表可能不準確，玩家詳情不可用。密碼僅用於這一次請求，絕不會被儲存；工作階段不會放在設定資料夾中。",
  "Two-factor authentication": "雙重驗證",
  "VRChat wants a second factor before it hands over the session.": "VRChat 需要第二重驗證才會交出工作階段。",
  "Verifying…": "驗證中…",
  "Verify": "驗證",
  "Unlock with Windows Hello": "使用 Windows Hello 解鎖",
  "Unlock the saved session": "解鎖已儲存的工作階段",
  "The session is protected by Windows Hello. Confirm with your PIN, fingerprint or face.": "工作階段受 Windows Hello 保護。請使用 PIN、指紋或臉部確認。",
  "The session was encrypted with a key derived from your password. It is never stored, so it has to be typed again.": "工作階段使用由密碼衍生的金鑰加密。金鑰不會被儲存，因此需要再次輸入。",
  "Unlocking…": "解鎖中…",
  "Unlock": "解鎖",
  "Forget it": "忘記",
  "Signed in to VRChat": "已登入 VRChat",
  "Session expires {date}": "工作階段到期 {date}",
  "Sign out": "登出",
  "Keep the session between launches": "在啟動之間保留工作階段",
  "Only the VRChat session cookie is stored, never your password. Every mode except \"Do not remember\" encrypts it at rest; the difference is what unlocks it.": "只儲存 VRChat 工作階段 Cookie，絕不儲存密碼。除「不記住」外，所有模式都會加密儲存，差別在於解鎖方式。",
  "Software key": "軟體金鑰",
  "obfuscation": "混淆",
  "weak": "弱",
  "Linux": "Linux",
  "AES-256-GCM with a key file next to the session; obfuscation only, not real protection.": "使用工作階段旁的金鑰檔案進行 AES-256-GCM 加密；只是混淆，不是真正的保護。",
  "encrypted": "加密",
  "fair": "一般",
  "Windows": "Windows",
  "Windows · Linux": "Windows · Linux",
  "Encrypted with Windows DPAPI for your account; unlocks automatically.": "使用 Windows DPAPI 綁定到你的帳號，自動解鎖。",
  "Held in the desktop keyring; unlocks with your login session.": "儲存在桌面鑰匙圈中，隨登入工作階段解鎖。",
